        "version": "1.0.0",
        "title": "DC Advocate Name API",
        "description": "API provides list of cases from a court establishment matching name of the Advocate. Input for this API is Establishment Code, Ad vocate\u2019s Name, Case Registration Year, Status of the Case (Pending or Disposed) and other details. The Advocate\u2019s name may be petitioner\u2019s advocate name or respondent\u2019s advocate name or an extra party advocate name. The search string for advocate name may consist of full name of the Advocate or even few characters (minimum 3) for searching."
    },
